{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"无。虽然Y纵向交替的信息层次更多，但关键词加亮、感受字缩小、部分感受按音乐节点出现，降低了同时阅读的负担。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y能让我先抓住加亮的叙事重点，再随着音乐逐步看到对应的感受，不必一次处理所有描述。它尤其把人物为什么既怀念从前的亲近、又不愿回去承受委屈，以及孤单、希望和自我保护之间反复拉扯的原因交代得更清楚。相比之下，X虽然左右分栏直观，但右侧感受容易变成并列标签，情绪变化的先后、音乐与心理的对应关系，以及人物前后想法的细微转变，都不如Y完整。</escape>\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d7dcdbaf-ff76-4925-bb0e-f6b245e1d876", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T061915556329Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:20:55.664019+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b51e27fa85614edd1311bf85473caa5317e1cd37243ca7834cd0801ae3ed2577", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156de